<title>USA: Walden acquires Arlington, Texas property.</title>
<headline>Walden acquires Arlington, Texas property.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walden Residential Properties Inc said on Thursday it bought Treepoint Village, a garden apartment property in Arlington, Texas for approximately $5.7 million, including closing costs.</p>
<p>Treepoint Village, located in the Treepoint area of southwest Arlington, was constructed in 1983 and consists of 16 two-story buildings.</p>
<p>Walden Residential is a self-administered and self-managed real estate investment trust which owns garden apartment communities serving middle-income apartment residents.</p>
</text>
